1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Let’s make a playable RPG.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Create an RPG in a city where memories are currency.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000
A city takes shape.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Make me a forgotten courier. Add one friend who still remembers me.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,000
You are the courier.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,000
One person remembers.

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Two guards block the gate. Let me show the letter or trade a memory.

8
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Now there is a decision.

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Try what you made.

10
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Walk to the gate. Show the letter. Earn their trust.

11
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Make the guards remember me and let me pass next time.

12
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:24,000
The guards remember you and let you pass.

13
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Describe. Preview. Play. Refine. — alteru.app
